   293	/****************************************************************************
   294	 * Name: flash_ipc_rx
   295	 *
   296	 * Description:
   297	 *   One frame arrived from the CP on the IPC channel.  Interrupt context:
   298	 *   record what came in and wake the requester, nothing else.
   299	 *
